      "writtenOn": "2018-09-14T09:56:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IT8320 doesn\u0027t have default hardware NaN.\nIf the operation is return NaN, the format will be:\nexponent field \u003d 0xff, mantissa field \u003d a non-zero number (not a constant value, depend on operation result)\n\nWe use 0xffc00000 as NaN is the same with GCC library routine.\nhttps://github.com/gcc-mirror/gcc/blob/26f8bcbd5ca246308c1dfc17e71d01ccc5741e74/libgcc/config/nds32/lib1asmsrc-mculib.S#L2249\nDo we need to change it to 0xffffffff?",
